# Force LF everywhere, regardless of the checkout OS. Windows dev machines
# are common on this project; without this, autocrlf turns shell scripts
# into CRLF and breaks `#!/bin/sh` inside Linux containers (frontend
# Dockerfile's docker-entrypoint.d/env-config.sh) — a classic, easy-to-miss
# failure mode that only shows up at container runtime, not at build time.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
